---
---

<section
  style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;padding:4.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;min-height:calc(100vh - 56px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;"
>
  <!-- Hero content -->
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:700px;width:100%;">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <div class="fade-in" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <span style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A84D30;">CardHabit</span>
      <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#C75B39;"></div>
      <span style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A84D30;">Available now</span>
      <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#C75B39;"></div>
      <span style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A84D30;">iOS</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Kicker: the product's own voice, handwritten per the hand rule -->
    <p
      class="fade-in"
      style="font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4.5vw,2.15rem);line-height:1;color:#A84D30;margin:0 0 0.5rem;"
    >
      Show up. Every day.
    </p>

    <!-- H1: brand + mechanic -->
    <h1
      class="fade-in"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,7.5vw,4rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#2E2115;margin:0 0 1.75rem;"
    >
      Your habits, dealt as <em style="color:#A84D30;font-style:italic;">a hand of cards.</em>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subhead: canonical entity sentence first, then the thesis -->
    <p
      class="fade-in"
      style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.65;color:#766449;max-width:580px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;"
    >
      CardHabit is an iOS daily challenge app built on trading-card-game mechanics: every morning it deals you five habit cards, and you commit to what you can handle that day. The goal is hard things every day, not extreme things once. When a friend believes you can handle more, they can play a Challenge card that makes tomorrow's draw harder.
    </p>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="fade-in">
      <a
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cardhabit-tcg-habit-tracker/id6768107296"
        class="hero-cta"
        data-appstore-cta="hero"
        style="display:inline-block;background:#C75B39;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:1rem 2.25rem;border-radius:3px;text-decoration:none;transition:background 0.2s,transform 0.2s;border:1px solid #C75B39;"
      >
        Download on the App Store
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Below CTA note -->
    <p
      class="fade-in"
      style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#75654D;margin-top:1.25rem;"
    >
      Free to start &nbsp;·&nbsp; Founder pricing, live in the app now
    </p>

    <!-- The product itself: today's hand, rendered as the app renders it
         (parchment faces, painted category bands, 2px category border).
         Replaces a stale dark-theme screenshot with a live illustration of
         the current Guild Hall card system, not a claimed device capture. -->
    <div class="fade-in hand-mock" role="img" aria-label="Today's hand: three habit cards on parchment, two completed and sealed">
      <div class="hand-card warm-shadow" style="--rot:-9deg;--tx:-58px;--band:#B8422E;">
        <div class="hand-card-band">Physical</div>
        <p class="hand-card-title">Iron Discipline</p>
        <div class="hand-card-check is-done" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hand-card warm-shadow" style="--rot:0deg;--tx:0px;--band:#3D77B5;z-index:2;">
        <div class="hand-card-band">Mental</div>
        <p class="hand-card-title">The Hard Conversation</p>
        <div class="hand-card-check is-done" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hand-card warm-shadow" style="--rot:9deg;--tx:58px;--band:#7A4FA8;">
        <div class="hand-card-band">Recovery</div>
        <p class="hand-card-title">Dead Hours</p>
        <div class="hand-card-check" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: #A8462A;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .hand-mock {
    position: relative;
    width: min(320px, 78vw);
    height: 210px;
    margin: 3.5rem auto 0;
  }

  .hand-card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    width: 128px;
    height: 176px;
    margin-left: -64px;
    background: #FDF7EA;
    border: 2px solid var(--band);
    border-radius: 14px;
    transform: rotate(var(--rot)) translateX(var(--tx));
    padding: 10px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hand-card-band {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--band);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: 'Jost', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .hand-card-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #2E2115;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hand-card-check {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(46, 33, 21, 0.25);
  }

  .hand-card-check.is-done {
    border-color: #C75B39;
    background: #C75B39;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
